{"4063510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Salene", "steam_appid": 4063510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend Into the Heavens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fallen Shard of a dying age given life, traverse the layers of heaven and face the Seven Virtues! Prepare yourself with the Songs of Creation to challenge powerful foes, complete tricky platforming challenges and solve ancient mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063510/extras/62cd0ddf2f44ebe78dccbfaba6350ea5.avif?t=1786892727\" width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 2 handcrafted worlds at the same time, switching between the real world and an ethereal dimension full of cosmic power. Acquire new spells and attacks to defeat the unique bosses that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063510/extras/e81ce8377c3c353babb84b32ccbca94f.avif?t=1786892727\" width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ascend Into the Heavens</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fallen Shard of a dying age given life, traverse the layers of heaven and face the Seven Virtues! Prepare yourself with the Songs of Creation to challenge powerful foes, complete tricky platforming challenges and solve ancient mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063510/extras/62cd0ddf2f44ebe78dccbfaba6350ea5.avif?t=1786892727\" width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 2 handcrafted worlds at the same time, switching between the real world and an ethereal dimension full of cosmic power. Acquire new spells and attacks to defeat the unique bosses that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063510/extras/e81ce8377c3c353babb84b32ccbca94f.avif?t=1786892727\" width=1560 height=384 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Salene is a action-platformer with quick precise combat set in a world ravaged by a war of angels and men. Conquer the Seven Virtues, gain new skills and learn the Songs of Creation to rise up and face the divinity that commands them all!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063510/5398ade253729fe17ebf9e98d4a585c320603b1c/header.jpg?t=1786892727", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063510/cf843b61f4b26e3f075b008b9417a6e746337d24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786892727", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063510/cf843b61f4b26e3f075b008b9417a6e746337d24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786892727", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows Processor<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> A CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> A GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> A Sound Card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["DejaView"], "publishers": ["DejaView"], "demos": [{"appid": 4567810, "description": ""}, {"appid": 4567810, "description": ""}], "package_groups